y the team needs it, how Git or GitHub implements it, which commands or interface actions are involved, what can go wrong, and how the result is verified.\n\nA strong practical answer describes the repository state before the operation, the exact steps performed, the evidence collected, and the final state. Avoid saying only that a command was executed. Explain what the command changed and how that change was confirmed."
